  "description": "OEDRO Upgrade your 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 Double/Extended Cab, 2020-2026 2500HD 3500HD double/Extended Cab with heavy-duty running boards designed for durability, style, and everyday convenience. Featuring a custom fit and a rugged carbon steel build, these side steps support up to 450 lbs per side with dual-stage e-coating for rust resistance. The 3.9-inch drop-down design offers safer, easier access for passengers, while the 4-inch wide non-slip surface ensures secure footing in any condition. With quick, no-drill installation, you can easily enhance your truck's look and functionality in under 20 minutes — perfect for work, travel, or outdoor adventures.\nFeatures\nPerfect Fitment: Custom-designed for 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 Double/Extended Cab, 2020-2026 2500HD 3500HD double/Extended Cab, ensuring a sleek, factory-style appearance.\nHeavy-Duty Strength: Built from carbon steel with a reinforced square tube structure, each side supports up to 450 lbs.\nSafe & Comfortable Access : 3.9-inch drop step with a 4.5-inch wide, non-slip surface for easier and safer entry in all conditions.\nCorrosion & Weather Resistant : Dual-stage e-coating protects against rust, corrosion, and harsh weather environments.\nQuick Bolt-On Installation: No drilling required; includes all mounting hardware for a fast, DIY install quickly.\n1-Year Warranty & Professional Installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 Double/Extended Cab, 2020-2025 2500HD 3500HD\nCompatible with 2020-2026 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Double/Extended Cab",
